  "note": "Election of the Limavady Urban District Council, 21 May 1958; nine nominations for nine seats, so there was no contest (Londonderry Standard, 9 May 1958, p. 1). Nine nominations for nine seats, no contest. The paper prints (U.) beside Barbour, Gilloway, Hull, Moffatt, Moore, Stinson and Thorpe, and (Labour) beside McLaughlin; McCausland carries no label in the list. The new members were Moffatt, Moore and McCausland. Returned unopposed."
